abstract: >-
  Evidence-controlled public research repository and data-driven portal mapping
  contactless sensing, physiological and behavioral inference, silent-speech
  interfaces, mobile and aerial systems, directed actuation, adaptive artificial
  intelligence, evidence architecture, and ambient-sensing governance. Release
  0.4.0 includes public-safe source, claim, pathway, trunk, and correction
  registries with linked navigation and explicit public/private boundaries.
keywords:
  - ambient sensing
  - contactless physiology
  - Wi-Fi sensing
  - radar sensing
  - neurotechnology
  - unmanned aerial systems
  - evidence architecture
  - cognitive sovereignty
  - privacy engineering
  - public evidence registry
